        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Hughes, Julia Morris, Fletcher Pilon\n- TV Shows: Australia's Got Talent (season 8)\n- Roles: host, winner\n- Topics: Australian entertainment\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Hughes, whose full name is David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes, was born on 26 November 1970 in Warrnambool, Victoria.\n- Dave Hughes is an Australian stand-up comedian and a radio and television presenter.\n- Fletcher Pilon was born on 6 April 2001.\n- In March 2016, Fletcher Pilon won the eighth season of Australia's Got Talent.\n- Fletcher Pilon is an Australian acoustic singer and songwriter.\n- On Australia's Got Talent season 8, Julia Morris did not return as host because she was committed to another show.\n- On Australia's Got Talent season 8, Dave Hughes replaced Julia Morris as host.",
